    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42064" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">russātus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		russus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>clothed in red</i>, <i>a designation
				of one of the parties of charioteers in the circus.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">factio, v. factio: auriga,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					7, 53, 54, § 186</span></i>
			 (al. russei).—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguine suo russatus,</span>”
				<i>red</i>, <i>reddened</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Coron. Mil. 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
